# Young Wolf's undying (CR 702.93a): Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with free mana. Bot2 destroys it on turn 2 with Infernal Grasp
# (paid with a Mox Jet and a Mox Ruby): it had no +1/+1 counters, so it returns to the battlefield under its owner's control
# with exactly one, a 1/1 plus the counter (checked while it is back). Destroyed again, now with a +1/+1 counter on it, it
# stays in the graveyard. Bot2 pays 2 life for each Grasp.

